 will affect the infection simulation system and lead to different playthroughs each time. Drastic actions might lead to drastic results!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Multiple Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some always will have to fall - but you can save the town. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on what faction you support and how you perform you will run into several endings. Ranging from a city collapse to your town-wide celebration. Or your execution. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique and special style inspired by the breathtaking Apocalypse Tapestry (<i>Tenture de l'Apocalypse). Woven </i>stillness from the style of this medieval &quot;comic&quot; is brought to life and transformed into a historically very non-accurate adventure. </p>", "short_description": "A top-down plague simulation RPG set in a living medieval tapestry. Play the last apothecary in a dying town treating the sick, containing the outbreak, and navigating the politics of factions who'd sooner see you burn.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Polish, Russian, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247520/14c5421087a582c25d161ca06626ed2cff6a97f0/header.jpg?t=1779887422", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247520/00dd569f909e3106fb8ceac8ecfea7a7c4193f69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779887422", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247520/00dd569f909e3106fb8ceac8ecfea7a7c4193f69/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779887422", "website": "https://introverseinteractive.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD F